data_case_a_rotamer
#
# Case A: one residue (Asp30) in two rotamers, 60/40, on a short grey poly-ALA chain.
# No relationship spans residues, so the new categories are not needed -- this is the
# baseline (plain altloc) the extension builds on. Only the Asp side chain splits A/B;
# the backbone and the flanking residues are single-conformer (altloc '.').
#
